// Title: UAC Bypass Abusing Winsat Path Parsing - Process
// ID: 7a01183d-71a2-46ad-ad5c-acd989ac1793
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Christian Burkard (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2021-08-30
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
// Description: Detects the pattern of UAC Bypass using a path parsing issue in winsat.exe (UACMe 52)
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(IntegrityLevel = "High") OR where(IntegrityLevel = "System") OR where(IntegrityLevel = "S-1-16-16384") OR where(IntegrityLevel = "S-1-16-12288")) AND where(ParentImage IENDSWITH "\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\system32\\winsat.exe") AND where(ParentCommandLine ICONTAINS "C:\\Windows \\system32\\winsat.exe"))
